#: xcash/webhooks/models.py:51
msgid ""
"认领投递时原子自增，是重试次数的唯一真源。不能用 attempts 关联表计数：任务在"
"写 DeliveryAttempt 之前被杀时，关联表计数不增长，重试上限就永远不会触发。"
msgstr ""
"Incremented atomically when a delivery is claimed; this is the single source "
"of truth for the retry count. Counting rows in the attempts table does not "
"work: if the task is killed before writing a DeliveryAttempt the count never "
"grows and the retry limit never triggers."

